f Hohenzollerns or Habsburgs ever was. Second, it commands and rests upon mass-support. It is no affair of an aristocratic class or a military caste. It is frankly for and by the half-educated and half-propertied lower middle class and upper proletariat. It springs from and returns to the great median of what are truly the masses, and everyone above or below who is not sycophantic is suspect and liable to liquida
